OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand to be sentenced for
OL,4,Arape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn total, he faced seven charges: three
OL,7,Fof rape, three of sexual assault and
OL,8,Fone of attempted indecent assault. He
OL,9,Fwas found not guilty on three counts
OL,11,FBrand's crimes took place between 2004
OL,12,Fand 2009, and related to four women.
OL,13,FThey are all entitled to lifelong
OL,14,Fanonymity
OL,16,FFollowing the verdicts, it can now be
OL,17,Freported that police are investigating
OL,18,Ffurther rape allegations made by two
OL,19,Fwomen against Brand
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
